<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Materials -- Lumberjack's List</h1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>

<pre>


<b>List compiled by Dryad.</b>
Wood combos are often unstable -- please let me know if you get different alloy results.

<b>All wood materials:</b>


bamboo 
bark
birch
cedar
cork
ebony
elm 
mahogany
maple
mallorn
oak
wood

bamboo + bark = ?
bamboo + birch = cedar
bamboo + cedar = birch
bamboo + ebony = oak
bamboo + elm = maple
bamboo + mahogany = elm
bamboo + maple = mahogany
bamboo + mallorn = ?
bamboo + oak = ?
bamboo + wood = birch

bark + bamboo = ?
bark + birch = cedar
bark + cedar = birch
bark + ebony = ?
bark + elm = oak
bark + mahogany = cedar
bark + maple = birch
bark + mallorn = ?
bark + oak = cedar
bark + wood = birch


birch + bamboo = cedar
birch + bark = ?
birch + cedar = maple 
birch + ebony = bamboo
birch + elm = cedar or mahogany
birch + mahogany = wood
birch + maple = elm
birch + mallorn = oak
birch + oak = maple
birch + wood = elm


cedar + bamboo = birch
cedar + bark = ?
cedar + birch = maple
cedar + ebony = ?
cedar + elm = maple
cedar + mahogany = maple
cedar + maple = mahogany
cedar + mallorn = elm
cedar + oak = mahogany
cedar + wood = oak or maple 


ebony + bamboo = oak
ebony + bark = ?
ebony + birch = bamboo
ebony + cedar = ? 
ebony + elm = bamboo or cedar
ebony + mahogany = bamboo
ebony + maple = bamboo
ebony + mallorn = bamboo
ebony + oak = bamboo
ebony + wood = bamboo


elm + bamboo = maple
elm + birch = cedar or mahogany
elm + cedar = maple
elm + ebony = bamboo or cedar
elm + mahogany = birch
elm + maple = birch
elm + mallorn = birch
elm + oak = ?
elm + wood = birch or oak


mahogany + bamboo = elm
mahogany + birch = wood
mahogany + cedar = maple
mahogany + ebony = bamboo
mahogany + elm = birch
mahogany + maple = birch 
mahogany + mallorn = oak 
mahogany + oak = birch or cedar
mahogany + wood = maple


maple + bamboo = mahogany
maple + birch = elm
maple + cedar = mahogany
maple + ebony = bamboo
maple + elm = birch
maple + mahogany = birch
maple + mallorn = ?
maple + oak = wood
maple + wood = cedar or oak


mallorn + bamboo = ?
mallorn + birch = oak
mallorn + cedar = elm
mallorn + ebony = bamboo
mallorn + elm = birch
mallorn + mahogany = oak
mallorn + maple = ?
mallorn + oak = mahogany or cedar
mallorn + wood = elm


oak + bamboo = ?
oak + birch = maple
oak + cedar = mahogany
oak + ebony = bamboo
oak + elm = ?
oak + mahogany = birch or cedar
oak + maple = wood
oak + mallorn = mahogany or cedar
oak + wood = mahogany or birch


wood + bamboo = birch
wood + birch = elm
wood + cedar = oak or maple
wood + ebony = bamboo
wood + elm = birch or oak
wood + mahogany = maple 
wood + maple = cedar or oak
wood + mallorn = elm
wood + oak = mahogany or birch


<b>Multi-combos:</b>

Random ones:
wood+oak+elm+maple+cedar = mahogany (or birch, yuck)                
mahogany+wood+oak+elm+maple+cedar = birch              


USEFUL ONES:     
birch+mahogany+wood+oak+elm+maple+cedar+ebony = bamboo                  
bamboo+birch+mahogany+wood+oak+elm+maple+cedar = ebony                  
bamboo+birch+mahogany+wood+oak+elm+maple+cedar+mallorn+ebony = bark

